{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/soul-cards-title.gif?t=1747388882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>Soul Cards is a single-player roguelike deck-builder game where you must create synergies to score points!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Soul Cards, everything is about scoring enough points to reach the goal before the deadline and survive. To score points you will play of board of Items and Souls.<br> <br> As you go deeper and deeper in hell, the goal will get higher and higher but don't worry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each round survived you will be rewarded with money. Spend this money in the shop to improve your build ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>It's up to you to choose how to spend your money!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items are the card that will form your deck. Each item has effects and tags. Buying new items will help you specialize your deck and create stronger synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/soul-cards-items.gif?t=1747388882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters are cards that are permanently on the board and will passively apply their effects. More expensive that items, they are also an essential part of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/soul-cards-characters.gif?t=1747388882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally, you can use spells to enchant your items and give them additional effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/soul-cards-spells.gif?t=1747388882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a huge amount of content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+50 Items to create your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+50 Souls with unique effects to recruit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Different spells to modify your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Materials to modify and boost your items</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408690?t=1747388882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747388882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/e74620129fb080fc825039b8b1525700529f7664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747388882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/e74620129fb080fc825039b8b1525700529f7664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747388882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/soul-cards-title.gif?t=1747388882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>Soul Cards is a single-player roguelike deck-builder game where you must create synergies to score points!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Soul Cards, everything is about scoring enough points to reach the goal before the deadline and survive. To score points you will play of board of Items and Souls.<br> <br> As you go deeper and deeper in hell, the goal will get higher and higher but don't worry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each round survived you will be rewarded with money. Spend this money in the shop to improve your build ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>It's up to you to choose how to spend your money!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items are the card that will form your deck. Each item has effects and tags. Buying new items will help you specialize your deck and create stronger synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/soul-cards-items.gif?t=1747388882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters are cards that are permanently on the board and will passively apply their effects. More expensive that items, they are also an essential part of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/soul-cards-characters.gif?t=1747388882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally, you can use spells to enchant your items and give them additional effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/extras/soul-cards-spells.gif?t=1747388882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a huge amount of content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+50 Items to create your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+50 Souls with unique effects to recruit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Different spells to modify your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Materials to modify and boost your items</p></li></ul>","developers":["Humble Forge"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408690/a07b75834b9dfd2204bc7ddaedd01ae277156917/header.jpg?t=1747388882","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119627,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119627/movie480.mp4?t=1747388880","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119627/movie_max.mp4?t=1747388880"},"name":"Soul Cards - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119627/f90cec7aeb1819bda8a0b3c32127972ce4e8849a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747388880","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119627/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747388880","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119627/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747388880"}}],"name":"Soul Cards","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible graphics card, integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li><